---

# Document Corpus

Create a synthetic but realistic document package.

The corpus should include approximately 10-15 documents.

## Supplier Contract

Fields:

* Supplier Name
* Effective Date
* Expiration Date
* SLA Requirements
* Temperature Requirements
* Liability Clauses
* Penalty Clauses

Example business rule:

Supplier is liable if shipment temperature exceeds 40°F for more than 30 minutes.

---

## Bill of Lading

Fields:

* Shipment ID
* Trailer ID
* Carrier Name
* Pickup Timestamp
* Delivery Timestamp
* Distribution Center
* Product Quantity

---

## Temperature Monitoring Log

Fields:

* Timestamp
* Temperature Reading
* Threshold
* Trailer Identifier

Example event:

37°F
38°F
44°F
47°F
48°F

This document should trigger a temperature excursion event.

---

## Certificate of Analysis

Fields:

* Supplier
* Lot Number
* Product
* Production Date
* Expiration Date
* Microbiology Results

---

## Quality Incident Report

Example narrative:

Trailer refrigeration unit failed for 68 minutes during transportation.

Maximum internal trailer temperature reached 48°F.

---

## Recall Notice

Fields:

* Lot Number
* Product
* Severity
* Recall Date
* Impact Scope

---

## Email Chain

Example topics:

* Shipment exception approvals
* Conditional release approvals
* Distribution center escalations
* Supplier communications

---

## Supplier Scorecard

Fields:

* On Time Delivery
* Fill Rate
* Defect Rate
* Temperature Violations
* Claims Frequency

---

